          "short": "$x=4,\\ y=-1$",
          "worked": "Subtract the first equation from the second.\n$$\\begin{align*}(4x-5y)-(-2x-5y)&=21-(-3)\\\\6x&=24\\\\x&=4\\\\-8-5y&=-3\\\\-5y&=5\\\\y&=-1\\end{align*}$$\nCheck: $-2(4)-5(-1)=-3$ and $4(4)-5(-1)=21$.",
